            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "The error is not in this repository. The mode `2031` spec says a terminal reports only when the palette changes, and `kitty` and `Ghostty` work the same way. The program should ask for the state at startup with `CSI ? 996 n`, which Neovim already answers.",
